        "edit": "No change: the supplied RTL already implements a 24-bit counter with synchronous clear and enable; the observed mismatch (Q=10 vs expected 16 at cycle 27) is not explained by any local defect in this module, so the minimal local patch is a no-op.",
        "lens_id": "generic_v1",
